How can I fetch data from a MySQL database using PHP code and display it in an HTML table? Can you provide a sample PHP code that demonstrates the process, including connecting to the database, executing the query, and generating the table? Thank you.
Sure, here's some sample code that demonstrates how to fetch data from a MySQL database using PHP and display it in an HTML table:
<?php
// Set database connection variables
$host = 'localhost';
$user = 'username';
$password = 'password';
$database = 'my_db';
// Connect to database
$conn = mysqli_connect($host, $user, $password, $database);
// Check connection
if (!$conn) {
  die("Connection failed: " . mysqli_connect_error());
}
// Define query to fetch data
$sql = "SELECT * FROM my_table";
// Execute query
$result = mysqli_query($conn, $sql);
// Generate HTML table
echo "<table>";
echo "<tr><th>ID</th><th>Name</th><th>Email</th></tr>";
while ($row = mysqli_fetch_assoc($result)) {
  echo "<tr><td>" . $row['id'] . "</td><td>" . $row['name'] . "</td><td>" . $row['email'] . "</td></tr>";
}
echo "</table>";
// Close database connection
mysqli_close($conn);
?>
Note that this is just a basic example and may need to be modified depending on the specific structure of your database and the data you want to display.

